    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d22">

                <pb facs="0112" n="44" sameAs="frus:frus1867p1/pg44"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Adams.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1905.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-01-11"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 11, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I enclose a copy of a communication of the
                    8th of December, addressed to the President by Kathleen M. Meany, in behalf of
                    her father, who appears <pb facs="0113" n="45" xml:id="pg45"/> to have been
                    arrested in Liverpool, probably on the ground of alleged complicity in recent
                    political disturbances in Great Britain. I will thank you to take such steps in
                    the matter as in your judgment may seem proper.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Francis Adams,</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d22-a1.xml" xpointer="d22-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
